【Question】
What is the name and capacity of the stadium with the most concerts after 2013 ?

SQL



====================

```sql
SELECT T1.`Name`, T1.`Capacity` 
FROM stadium AS T1 
JOIN concert AS T2 ON T1.`Stadium_ID` = T2.`Stadium_ID` 
WHERE T2.`Year` > '2013' 
GROUP BY T1.`Stadium_ID` 
ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC 
LIMIT 1
```

