【Question】
Find the name and location of the stadiums which some concerts happened in the years of both 2014 and 2015.

SQL



====================

```sql
SELECT DISTINCT T1.`Name`, T1.`Location` 
FROM stadium AS T1 
JOIN concert AS T2 ON T1.`Stadium_ID` = T2.`Stadium_ID` 
WHERE T2.`Year` = '2014' AND T1.`Stadium_ID` IN 
(SELECT T2.`Stadium_ID` FROM concert AS T2 WHERE T2.`Year` = '2015')
```

