【Question】
Find the first name of students who have both cat and dog pets .

SQL



====================

```sql
SELECT Fname 
FROM Student 
WHERE StuID IN (
    SELECT StuID 
    FROM Has_Pet 
    WHERE PetID IN (
        SELECT PetID 
        FROM Pets 
        WHERE PetType = 'cat'
    )
    INTERSECT
    SELECT StuID 
    FROM Has_Pet 
    WHERE PetID IN (
        SELECT PetID 
        FROM Pets 
        WHERE PetType = 'dog'
    )
)
```

