Find the make and production time of the cars that were produced in the earliest year?

SQL



====================

```sql
SELECT DISTINCT T4.`Make`, T7.`Year` 
FROM car_names AS T4 
JOIN model_list AS T3 ON T4.`Model` = T3.`Model` 
JOIN car_makers AS T2 ON T3.`Maker` = T2.`Id` 
JOIN countries AS T1 ON T2.`Country` = T1.`CountryId` 
JOIN continents AS T0 ON T1.`Continent` = T0.`ContId` 
JOIN cars_data AS T7 ON T4.`MakeId` = T7.`Id` 
WHERE T7.`Year` = (SELECT MIN(`Year`) FROM cars_data)
```

