【Question】
Among the cars with more than lowest horsepower, which ones do not have more than 3 cylinders? List the car makeid and make name.

SQL



====================

```sql
SELECT DISTINCT c.`MakeId`, cn.`Make`
FROM cars_data AS c
JOIN car_names AS cn ON c.`Id` = cn.`MakeId`
WHERE c.`Horsepower` > (SELECT MIN(`Horsepower`) FROM cars_data)
AND c.`Cylinders` <= 3
```

