【Question】
Which are the car makers which produce at least 2 models and more than 3 car makers ? List the id and the maker .

SQL



====================

```sql
SELECT `Id`, `Maker` FROM car_makers WHERE `Id` IN (SELECT `Maker` FROM model_list GROUP BY `Maker` HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT `Model`) >= 2) AND `Id` IN (SELECT `Maker` FROM model_list GROUP BY `Maker` HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT `Model`) > 3)
```

